      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_concept",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 四种基本操作\n\n- **相加**：同一时刻的值逐点相加。\n- **数乘**：每个样本乘以同一个常数。\n- **时移**：把 `t` 换成 `t - t0`。\n- **反转**：把样本顺序倒过来。\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellInsert",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_add",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellSelect",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_add",
      "align": "top-center"
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellInsertText",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_add",
      "target": {
        "kind": "end_of_file"
      },
      "text": "import numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\nfs = 100  # 采样率：每秒 100 个样本\nt = np.arange(0, 1.0, 1 / fs)  # 生成 0 到 1 秒的采样时间点\n\n",
      "speed_ms": 25
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellInsertText",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_add",
      "target": {
        "kind": "end_of_file"
      },
      "text": "f1 = 1.0\nf2 = 3.0\nx1 = np.sin(2 * np.pi * f1 * t)  # 1 Hz 的基准信号\nx2 = 0.5 * np.sin(2 * np.pi * f2 * t)  # 3 Hz、振幅 0.5 的第二成分\nx_sum = x1 + x2  # 两个信号逐点相加\n\n",
      "speed_ms": 25,
      "narration": {
        "during": {
          "asset_id": "narration_sec3_combine_transform",
          "clips": [
            {
              "offset_ms": 56000,
              "duration_ms": 7145,
              "caption": "先建立 1 Hz 和 3 Hz 两个成分，再把它们逐点<c.aqua>相加</c.aqua>；x_sum 就是同一时刻的两个值相加。"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellInsertText",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec3_add",
      "target": {
        "kind": "end_of_file"
      },
      "text": "plt.figure(figsize=(7, 3))\nplt.plot(t, x1, label=\"1 Hz\")\nplt.plot(t, x2, label=\"3 Hz, amplitude 0.5\")\nplt.plot(t, x_sum, label=\"sum\")\nplt.title(\"Adding two signals\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Time (s)\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Amplitude\")\nplt.legend()\nplt.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()\n",
      "speed_ms": 25,
      "narration": {
        "during": {
          "asset_id": "narration_sec3_combine_transform",
